# Ouyang et al., Calphad 85 (2024) 102680.
# Read README.txt: author LAMMPS and QuantumATK versions differ.
# Include AFTER units metal and creating/reading a box with types 1=Zr, 2=C.
# Run from this directory or supply the correct potential-file paths.
pair_style meam
pair_coeff * * library.meam Zr C ZrC.meam Zr C
